# ── Data & outputs (shared convention with SVcaller / poly-suite) ────────────
# Per-sample outputs and clinical/input data volumes — never committed. Kept on
# disk locally; untracked here. The ONLY committed report is docs/demo/ (below).
# TTSH/ — clinical WGS cohort (large); minibam/ — extracted region BAMs;
# staging/ — ad-hoc run logs/scratch; GRCh38 — symlink to local reference;
# Axiom.xlsx — Axiom array export (validation input data).
TTSH/
minibam/
staging/
GRCh38
Axiom.xlsx

